WEBVTT

00:16:29.662 --> 00:16:31.704
it was to expand the list. Mm hmm.

00:16:32.037 --> 00:16:34.621
Because I feel like the more I
know about what I don't know,

00:16:34.662 --> 00:16:37.579
the more curious I am and the more I'm
going to learn from people who are

00:16:37.579 --> 00:16:39.204
actually are knowledgeable in those areas.

00:16:39.954 --> 00:16:43.246
So, you know, my list, I think it
started out I immediately said

00:16:43.246 --> 00:16:46.829
I know nothing about music. I don't
understand financial markets.

00:16:46.829 --> 00:16:48.287
I'm clueless about chemistry.

00:16:49.246 --> 00:16:51.246
And, you know, the list just
kept growing from there.

00:16:51.246 --> 00:16:53.412
And I've actually been just
keeping that list.

00:16:53.454 --> 00:16:57.246
I have a file on my desktop and my goal is
to add something new to it every week.

00:16:57.537 --> 00:16:59.704
And if I stay clear about
what I don't know,

00:16:59.704 --> 00:17:03.204
then I hope I'm going to stay more humble,
more curious mindset.